# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# dspark-target.env.example — copy to dspark-target.env and edit
# =============================================================================
# The dspark scripts (start-dspark.sh, benchmark-dspark.py, …) read the GGUF they
# should serve from DSPARK_TARGET. The real file is gitignored because it holds
# one machine's absolute path — the original pointed into a workstation's
# Desktop folder, which means nothing on anyone else's box.
#
#   cp scripts/dspark-target.env.example scripts/dspark-target.env
#
# The shipped desktop build does NOT use dspark: main.js writes an llm-config
# with no dspark key on purpose, which is what pins every role to Ollama. This
# is only needed if you are running the backend on the agent box yourself.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Absolute path to the tuned Q4_K_M GGUF.
DSPARK_TARGET=/path/to/models/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Instruct-Uncensored.R20.Q4_K_M.gguf
